<title>USA: Clinton to announce National Security personnel.</title>
<headline>Clinton to announce National Security personnel.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. President Bill Clinton will make an announcement on his national security appointments at 1330 EST (1830 GMT) on Thursday, White House spokesman Mike McCurry said.</p>
<p>&quot;The president plans to make some announcements related to personnel in the national security area at 1:30,&quot; McCurry told reporters.</p>
